# A currency, not loot: it sells for nothing, and every clear drops one. The
# triangle marks its stage of the game and the colour marks which Root Abyss
# piece it buys.
name: "Piece of Mockery"
kind: ITEM_KIND_TOKEN
description: "A sliver of the mirror Chaos Pierre wears for a face, still wearing your own."
currency_mark: "▲"
currency_color: CURRENCY_COLOR_PINK
